pport database activities such as data modelling, performance monitoring, data cleansing, and tuning.","Monitor databases to ensure timely backup and recovery when required.","Ensure security of databases and administer relevant access to appropriate users; coordinate with IT deployment teams."],"source":{"library":"9789240116191-eng","section":"page-059","file":"who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-059.md","pdfPage":59,"method":"pc8-role-extraction"},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/v0/ns#glossary/dth-pc/national-product-catalogue","prefLabel":"National Product Catalogue"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/v0/ns#glossary/dth-pc/product-master-data","prefLabel":"Product Master Data"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/stakeholder","prefLabel":"Stakeholder"}],"archimate":{"model":"smart-ra 0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"PC-8 role record linked to smart-ra ArchiMate 0.3.0-draft.1 (dth-pc#2, smart-ra#147)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-610923d157564fa9a0d64621ba95c6cb.jsonld","name":"Stakeholder"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-ed45b0d35d7c5ccbbf4abe599a80be5c.jsonld","name":"National Product Catalogue"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-bb1fc1b7425444ed8a0c420bec960edd.jsonld","name":"Product Catalog Management System"}],"views":[]}},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns#"}],"@id":"papers/dth-pc/blocks/pers-pc-r-15","@type":["smart-base:Persona"],"label":"pers:pc-r-15","kind":"persona","title":"PC-R-15: Infrastructure Specialist (Annex 2)","text":"pers-pc-r-15.md","meta":{"title":"PC-R-15: Infrastructure Specialist (Annex 2)","roleId":"PC-R-15","personaType":"annex-implementation-role","processes":["PC-BP-06"],"responsibilities":["Category: Technical | Phases required: Deployment (Y), Operation (Y) | Position type: Permanent.","Design, implement, and manage server, network, virtualization, storage, and cloud infrastructure for the NPC.","Ensure systems and networks follow security best practices (patch management, malware protection, firewalls, VPNs, secure access controls) and comply with legal and regulatory requirements.","Define backup strategies and disaster recovery plans to ensure business continuity; optimize systems and networks for high availability and efficiency."],"source":{"library":"9789240116191-eng","section":"page-059","file":"who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-059.md","pdfPage":59,"method":"pc8-role-extraction"},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/v0/ns#glossary/dth-pc/national-product-catalogue","prefLabel":"National Product Catalogue"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/stakeholder","prefLabel":"Stakeholder"}],"archimate":{"model":"smart-ra 0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"PC-8 role record linked to smart-ra ArchiMate 0.3.0-draft.1 (dth-pc#2, smart-ra#147)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-610923d157564fa9a0d64621ba95c6cb.jsonld","name":"Stakeholder"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-ed45b0d35d7c5ccbbf4abe599a80be5c.jsonld","name":"National Product Catalogue"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-bb1fc1b7425444ed8a0c420bec960edd.jsonld","name":"Product Catalog Management System"}],"views":[]}},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns#"}],"@id":"papers/dth-pc/blocks/pers-pc-r-16","@type":["smart-base:Persona"],"label":"pers:pc-r-16","kind":"persona","title":"PC-R-16: QA / Test Manager (Annex 2)","text":"pers-pc-r-16.md","meta":{"title":"PC-R-16: QA / Test Manager (Annex 2)","roleId":"PC-R-16","personaType":"annex-implementation-role","processes":["PC-BP-06"],"responsibilities":["Category: Leadership | Phases required: Deployment (Y), Operation (N) | Position type: Contracted/temporary.","Manage testing teams to perform test scenarios such as system testing, performance testing, integration testing, and UAT.","Develop and guide the team in developing test cases and scripts based on business requirements.","Develop test management plans that include resource plan, risk management, timeline, and scope.","Coordinate across development and infrastructure teams and provide testing status reports to senior leadership."],"source":{"library":"9789240116191-eng","section":"page-060","file":"who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-060.md","pdfPage":60,"method":"pc8-role-extraction"},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/v0/ns#glossary/dth-pc/national-product-catalogue","prefLabel":"National Product Catalogue"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/stakeholder","prefLabel":"Stakeholder"}],"archimate":{"model":"smart-ra 0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"PC-8 role record linked to smart-ra ArchiMate 0.3.0-draft.1 (dth-pc#2, smart-ra#147)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-610923d157564fa9a0d64621ba95c6cb.jsonld","name":"Stakeholder"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-ed45b0d35d7c5ccbbf4abe599a80be5c.jsonld","name":"National Product Catalogue"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-bb1fc1b7425444ed8a0c420bec960edd.jsonld","name":"Product Catalog Management System"}],"views":[]}},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","smart-base":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-base/v0/ns#"}],"@id":"papers/dth-pc/blocks/pers-pc-r-17","@type":["smart-base:Persona"],"label":"pers:pc-r-17","kind":"persona","title":"PC-R-17: Test Analyst (Annex 2)","text":"pers-pc-r-17.md","meta":{"title":"PC-R-17: Test Analyst (Annex 2)","roleId":"PC-R-17","personaType":"annex-implementation-role","processes":["PC-BP-06"],"responsibilities":["Category: Technical | Phases required: Deployment (Y), Operation (N) | Position type: Contracted/temporary.","Develop test cases and scripts based on business requirements.","Conduct testing across different phases such as system testing, performance testing, integration testing, and UAT, and capture test results.","Coordinate across development and infrastructure teams to manage testing of IT tools at different intervals of the implementation."],"source":{"library":"9789240116191-eng","section":"page-060","file":"who-iris/library/9789240116191-eng/sections/page-060.md","pdfPage":60,"method":"pc8-role-extraction"},"glossary":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/v0/ns#glossary/dth-pc/national-product-catalogue","prefLabel":"National Product Catalogue"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/v0/ns#glossary/dpi-h-ra/stakeholder","prefLabel":"Stakeholder"}],"archimate":{"model":"smart-ra 0.3.0-draft.1","basis":"PC-8 role record linked to smart-ra ArchiMate 0.3.0-draft.1 (dth-pc#2, smart-ra#147)","elements":[{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-610923d157564fa9a0d64621ba95c6cb.jsonld","name":"Stakeholder"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-ed45b0d35d7c5ccbbf4abe599a80be5c.jsonld","name":"National Product Catalogue"},{"iri":"https://litlfred.github.io/smart-ra/archimate/0.3.0-draft.1/elements/id-bb1fc1b7425444ed8a0c420bec960edd.jsonld","name":"Product Catalog Management System"}],"views":[]}},"provenance":"authored"},{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/dth-pc/ns/context/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","